  "task": "I'm organizing a business trip to Boston from August 5-9 and need assistance with accommodations and transportation. First, find the top-rated hotels downtown and book the highest-rated one, then reserve a premium fuel car rental from either Enterprise or Avis for the entire stay after comparing their daily rates and customer feedback, and finally locate the address of 'Legal Sea Foods' restaurant and schedule a team dinner calendar event for August 7 at 7 PM."
